atom_style granular
atom_modify map array
boundary f f f
newton off
communicate single vel yes
units si
hard_particles yes
region dom block -0.5 0.5 -0.5 0.5 -0.5 0.5 units box
create_box 2 dom
neighbor 0.01 bin
neigh_modify delay 0
fix p1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 70000000000.0 1e15
fix p2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.33 0.25
fix p3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 2 1 1 1 1
fix p4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 2 0 0 0 0
pair_style gran model hertz tangential history
pair_coeff * *
fix w all wall/gran model hertz tangential history primitive type 2 zplane 0.0
create_atoms 1 single 0 0 0.10000100000000001 units box
set atom * diameter 0.2 density 2700.0
set atom 1 vz -0.2
timestep 3.6283442749786406e-06
fix integr all nve/sphere
variable d equal 0.1-z[1]
variable fz1 equal fz[1]
thermo_style custom step v_d v_fz1
thermo_modify format float %.17g norm no
thermo 1
run 301
